### Scenario 2 — Fire Moderation, Entry Budget (~$2,069)

**Buy the [Three Stone Lab-Grown in 14k Rose Gold at $1,620](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-lab-grown-diamond-three-stone-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-by-james-allen-item-315101?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** (133 reviews) + 1ct Forever One DEF moissanite. Rose gold absorbs the electric-rainbow fire toward amber-warm. Same $2,069 total. Best pick if you like moissanite fire but want it warm, not electric.

