**Buy the [Side Stone Shared Prong in 14k White Gold at $2,350](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-shared-prong-engagement-ring-in-14k-white-gold-by-james-allen-item-305147?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** + 2ct Forever One DEF moissanite (~$949). Total: ~$3,299. A 2ct marquise moissanite at 11.5x5.8mm face-up is one of the largest visual statements in the engagement ring market under $4,000. Lab diamond 2ct equivalent: ~$4,562. You save $1,263.

### Scenario 4 — Platinum Lifetime Ring (~$3,499)

**Buy the [Side Stone in Platinum at $2,550](https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/marquise-cut-side-stone-diamond-shared-prong-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-305152?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational)** + 2ct Forever One DEF moissanite (~$949). Total: ~$3,499. Platinum setting with a 2ct moissanite under $3,500 is impossible with a lab diamond — the 2ct lab stone alone starts at $2,212. The platinum side stone setting adds $2,550 = $4,762 minimum with lab. You save $1,263 by choosing moissanite.

